django-oscar (4.2.1-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Initial Debian release.
    - python3-oscar: Django Oscar e-commerce framework library
    - django-oscar-sandbox: demo site running as systemd service via
      uWsgi
    - All Python dependencies satisfied by existing Debian packages
      (no pip/venv)
    - Static assets pre-built upstream, no npm needed at build time
    - Uses sorl-thumbnail for image thumbnails (easy-thumbnails not
      packaged in Debian)

 -- Petter Reinholdtsen <pere@debian.org>  Mon, 24 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
